\newlabel{intro_figure}{{1}{2}{\textbf {Comparison between (a) prior turn-level, handcrafted operations and (b) MemSkill’s span-level, skill-conditioned generation.} Prior methods interleave handcrafted operations with LLM calls to incrementally extract and revise memory turn by turn, while MemSkill selects a small set of skills from a shared skill bank and applies them in one pass to produce skill-guided memories.\relax }{figure.caption.1}{}}
